flowchart TD
    A[Final transcript from Parakeet STT] --> B[classify_request transcript cfg]

    B --> C{Local deterministic guard?}
    C -->|close / cancel phrase| D[RouterDecision<br/>IMMEDIATE_ONLY<br/>ack NONE<br/>confidence 1.0]
    C -->|not local| E{Injected engine?}

    E -->|yes| F[IntentClassificationEngine.classify<br/>future BERT / ONNX router]
    E -->|no| G[DEFAULT_INTENT_ENGINE]

    G --> H[LlmIntentClassificationEngine]
    H --> I{Prewarmed provider client?}
    I -->|yes| J[classify_with_client]
    I -->|no| K[resolve provider client<br/>cache client + model]
    K --> J

    J --> L[LLM JSON decision<br/>complexity, route_target, ack,<br/>tool flags, risk, confidence, reason]
    F --> L
    D --> M[choose_voice_route]
    L --> M

    M --> N{Route target}
    N -->|IMMEDIATE_ONLY / local| O[Local voice action<br/>no Hermes]
    N -->|SMALL_MODEL / chat| P[Small model answer path]
    N -->|HEAVY_AGENT / agent| Q[Hermes Agent path]
    N -->|SAFETY / clarification| R[Canned safety or clarify response]

    Q --> S[Later: logged examples distill into BERT router]
    L --> S

    classDef current fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#4978c7,color:#111;
    classDef future fill:#e8ffe8,stroke:#3a9b48,color:#111;
    classDef local fill:#fff6d7,stroke:#b58900,color:#111;
    classDef output fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#805ad5,color:#111;

    class B,E,G,H,I,J,K,L,M,N current;
    class F,S future;
    class C,D,O local;
    class P,Q,R output;
